From: Li Guan <guanli.oerv@isrc.iscas.ac.cn>
Subject: [PATCH] tests: Accept quoted invalid option diagnostics

Current glibc getopt diagnostics quote the rejected option as 'H'.  The
older unquoted form is still valid, so accept both without weakening the
test that cvs admin -H rejects the option and aborts.

Signed-off-by: Li Guan <guanli.oerv@isrc.iscas.ac.cn>
---
diff --git a/src/sanity.sh b/src/sanity.sh
--- a/src/sanity.sh
+++ b/src/sanity.sh
@@ -3329,7 +3329,7 @@
 	  # otherwise the other, so accept both of them. -- mdb
 	  dotest_fail basicb-21 "${testcvs} -q admin -H" \
-"admin: invalid option -- H
+"admin: invalid option -- '\{0,1\}H'\{0,1\}
 ${CPROG} \[admin aborted\]: specify ${CPROG} -H admin for usage information" \
-"admin: illegal option -- H
+"admin: illegal option -- '\{0,1\}H'\{0,1\}
 ${CPROG} \[admin aborted\]: specify ${CPROG} -H admin for usage information"
 	  cd ..
